Hi,
I have launched on a server an R script to rename like 500GB of photos with the imageRename function. The problem is that it is running in an insane amount of time. I gave it a time of 16 hours and lots of memory, since I noticed it uses lots of memory. The problem is that it hits the time limit everytime and cannot finish.
I see that it doesn't require a lot of CPU work from the server stats i receive. Is it that I need to break down the work in smaller folders?
Any suggestion on how to parallelize work? And how can I keep better track of the progress I have made?

Thanks in advance,
