Hi Laurence,
Jürgen will know better but I think that parallelisation will slow things down in this case and should be avoided.
This work will a priori require hardly any CPU but a lot of disk usage.
The best would be to do that on a SSD disk (fast read and write) and if the job does not require a lot of memory (to check by monitoring memory usage), you may even do that on a laptop.
++
Alex

